# Scratch output from a check run: the DOM/screenshot/Chrome log and the
# per-run Chrome profile. Regenerated on every run; never evidence to commit.
*.log
*.png
dom.html
network.log
*-profile/
profile/
# S6's fixture is GENERATED by `web/scripts/browser-check/gen-fixture.test.ts`
# (real engine states), not authored: regenerate it, never commit it.
fixture.json
# S7's fixture is COPIED from the read-only probe
# (`.gate-logs/probe-stuck/fixture.json`: the owner's own snapshot chain, read
# read-only from the live store and sha256-verified there). Scratch; never commit.
s7-fixture.json
s7-dist/
# S8's fixture is GENERATED by `web/scripts/browser-check/gen-fixture-s8.test.ts`
# (real engine states, round-tripped through the app's own parsers). Scratch;
# regenerate it, never commit it. Its `s8-dist/` is the `--mode test` build the
# check drives (that mode is what carries the `window.__colossusDispatch` handle).
s8-fixture.json
s8-dist/
# S9's fixture is GENERATED by `web/scripts/browser-check/gen-fixture-s9.test.ts`
# (three real engine states — a resignable game, an in-battle game, and two games
# for the delete — round-tripped through the app's own parsers). Scratch;
# regenerate it, never commit it. `s9-dist/` is the `--mode test` build the check
# drives; that mode is what carries `window.__colossusDispatch`.
s9-fixture.json
s9-dist/
